from ground_author import *
source('usace-sheet','美國陸軍工兵署：鋼板樁牆設計手冊','USACE: Design of Sheet Pile Walls, EM 1110-2-2504','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/Portals/76/Publications/EngineerManuals/EM_1110-2-2504.pdf','一九九四年公開手冊，涵蓋板樁、土壤互制及施工考量；本課簡化算例不代表完整圍堰設計。','Public 1994 manual on sheet piles, soil interaction and construction; simplified exercises are not a complete cofferdam design.')
add('b181','咬合幾何、先後樁齡期與止水連續性~Secant geometry, primary-pile age and cutoff continuity','咬合樁牆以相鄰樁體互相切入形成連續擋土與止水系統，其性能受樁位、垂直度、切削時齡及結構樁剛度共同控制。本課將幾何咬合與材料強度分開驗證，再檢查冠梁傳力、嵌入深度、缺口滲流與長期裂縫，建立全深度的竣工證據。~Secant walls use overlapping piles to form a retaining and cutoff system governed by position, verticality, cutting age and structural-pile stiffness. The course verifies geometric overlap separately from material strength, then examines capping-beam transfer, embedment, defect seepage and long-term cracking through full-depth as-built evidence.',compact(r'''
設計咬合量~Nominal overlap || 相鄰圓樁相交形成牆體連續性，中心距與直徑共同決定名目咬合量。樁位偏差及鑽孔彎曲會沿深度改變實際交疊，槽口看起來連續不代表深部也完整；止水與結構連續性須分別考慮主次樁材料及鋼筋配置。~Intersecting circular piles create wall continuity, with centre spacing and diameter defining nominal overlap. Position errors and curved bores change overlap with depth, so a continuous collar does not prove deep continuity. Hydraulic and structural performance must separately account for primary-secondary materials and reinforcement arrangements. || 假設相同樁徑D=1.0 m、中心距s=0.8 m，名目咬合o=D−s=0.20 m~For equal pile diameter D=1.0 m and spacing s=0.8 m, nominal overlap o=D−s=0.20 m || 量測導牆樁位與全深孔斜，重建相鄰圓柱交集，將最小咬合位置與含水層對照。~Survey guide-wall positions and full-depth inclinations, reconstruct adjacent cylinder intersections, and compare minimum overlap locations with aquifers. || 深部樁體分離會形成滲流缺口，土砂流失可能先於可見牆面裂縫出現。~Deep separation creates seepage gaps, and soil loss may precede visible wall cracking. || 樁頂有咬合就能保證所有深度的止水連續性。~Overlap at the pile heads guarantees cutoff continuity at every depth. || 咬合驗收須採全深相對幾何，不只查單樁容許誤差；異常段由地工設計者核定補充驗證。~Accept overlap from full-depth relative geometry rather than single-pile tolerances alone; the geotechnical designer approves supplementary investigation of anomalies. || 此式只給兩個等直徑平行圓柱的線性咬合尺寸，未證明接觸品質或抗剪連續性；不等徑與偏斜需按三維幾何處理。~This expression gives a linear overlap for equal parallel cylinders only and proves neither contact quality nor shear continuity; unequal diameters and deviations require three-dimensional geometry.
先行樁切削齡期~Primary-pile cutting age || 次樁鑽掘必須切入先行樁，先行材料太軟可能被擠移，太硬則會使刀具偏轉或難以切削。可切削窗口受配比、溫度與養護影響，不能只用日曆天數管理；施工排程需與材料強度發展及實際切入紀錄連結。~Secondary drilling must cut into primary piles. Material that is too soft may displace, while excessive hardness can deflect tools or impede cutting. The workable window depends on mix, temperature and curing, so calendar age alone is inadequate; sequencing must be linked to strength development and actual cutting behaviour. || 假設先行樁澆置完成t₁=24 h、次樁切入t₂=96 h，相對齡期Δt=t₂−t₁=72 h~For primary completion t₁=24 h and secondary cutting t₂=96 h on one clock, elapsed age Δt=72 h || 以同養護試體與溫度紀錄核對切削時強度，再比較鑽進扭矩、偏斜與回收材料。~Use companion-cured samples and temperature records to estimate cutting-age strength, then compare drilling torque, deviation and recovered material. || 齡期超窗可能使次樁偏離先行樁，留下深部未咬合帶，即使鑽達設計深度仍無法止水。~Cutting outside the workable window can deflect the secondary pile and leave a deep unconnected strip despite reaching design depth. || 固定等三天就能適用所有氣溫與先行樁配比。~Waiting a fixed three days works for every temperature and primary-pile mix. || 排程需保留澆置、切入及材料強度證據；延誤時由材料及成樁負責人重新核定切削窗口。~Retain placement, cutting and strength evidence in the schedule; materials and piling leads reassess the cutting window after delays. || 時間差不是材料強度，亦沒有通用合格齡期；應以代表性試驗建立強度與可切削性的場址關係。~Elapsed time is not material strength and has no universal acceptance age; representative tests must establish the site-specific relation between strength and cuttability.
結構樁剛度~Structural-pile stiffness || 擋土牆的彎曲剛度取決於真正承擔結構作用的樁列，不能把所有軟質先行樁都當成同樣剛度的鋼筋混凝土。圓截面慣性矩隨直徑四次方增加，但開裂、咬合切削與配筋會改變有效剛度，並影響各樁分擔的土壓。~Wall bending stiffness depends on the piles actually assigned structural action; soft primary piles cannot automatically be treated as equally stiff reinforced concrete. Circular-section inertia increases with diameter to the fourth power, but cracking, secant cuts and reinforcement change effective stiffness and the pressure shared by individual piles. || 假設完整實心圓截面D=1 m，毛截面I=πD⁴/64=0.0491 m⁴~For a complete solid circular section D=1 m, gross second moment I=πD⁴/64=0.0491 m⁴ || 將實際樁徑、切削輪廓及鋼筋位置輸入截面分析，以測得牆位移比較開裂與未開裂剛度範圍。~Insert actual diameter, cut profile and reinforcement into section analysis, comparing measured wall movement with cracked and uncracked stiffness bounds. || 高估先行樁剛度會低估牆位移，並錯估冠梁與支撐反力，造成鄰近資產變形超出預期。~Overstating primary-pile stiffness underestimates wall movement and misallocates cap and strut forces, increasing unexpected adjacent-asset deformation. || 所有咬合樁都可以用相同的毛截面剛度相加。~All secant piles can be added using identical gross-section stiffness. || 計算書應標明主次樁各自材料與開裂假設；結構設計者核准等值牆剛度後才用於整體開挖模型。~Identify primary-secondary materials and cracking assumptions; the structural designer approves equivalent wall stiffness before it is used in excavation analysis. || 毛截面慣性矩是幾何量而非整體牆剛度，還須乘相應模數並考慮每米樁數；裂縫及接觸滑移可能主導變形。~Gross inertia is geometric rather than system stiffness; the corresponding modulus and piles per metre are also needed, while cracking and interface slip may govern deformation.
冠梁荷載轉移~Capping-beam transfer || 冠梁把不均勻樁頭反力重新分配到鄰近樁體，並為上部支撐提供連續的傳力界面。它的作用取決於樁頭嵌入、鋼筋錨定與接縫，不能只把冠梁視為整平構件；局部空樁或樁頭缺陷會增加其跨越需求。~A capping beam redistributes unequal pile-head reactions and provides a continuous interface for upper support. Its function depends on pile embedment, reinforcement anchorage and joints, not merely surface levelling. A missing or defective pile head increases the distance over which the beam must bridge and transfer load. || 假設簡支冠梁跨L=3 m、跨中集中力P=400 kN，Mmax=PL/4=300 kN·m~For a simply supported cap span L=3 m and central force P=400 kN, Mmax=PL/4=300 kN·m || 核對樁頭標高、混凝土品質與主筋錨定長度，將支撐反力位置和樁中心放在同一配筋圖。~Verify pile-head level, concrete quality and bar anchorage, placing support reactions and pile centres on one reinforcement drawing. || 樁頭處理不足使冠梁局部失去支承，裂縫可能集中在支撐座下方並造成反力轉移。~Poor pile-head preparation can remove local cap support, concentrating cracks below strut seats and redistributing reactions. || 冠梁只是把樁頭連起來，不需要分析彎矩與剪力。~A cap merely connects pile heads and needs no bending or shear analysis. || 澆置前確認樁頭與冠梁傳力細部；支撐位置變更須由冠梁設計者重新核對，而非現場直接移座。~Confirm pile-head transfer details before casting; the cap designer reviews support relocation instead of allowing seats to be moved directly on site. || 簡支點載模型只示範局部彎矩，真實冠梁常為連續梁且受扭；樁頭剛度及支撐偏心須另行納入。~The simple point-load model illustrates local bending only; actual caps are often continuous and torsion-sensitive, requiring pile-head stiffness and support eccentricity.
閉合定位誤差~Closure positioning error || 封閉圍護牆的最後接合位置累積了前面樁位誤差，不能假設每根樁單獨合格就能自然閉合。誤差可能有共同方向的系統偏差，也可能是獨立隨機偏差；兩者需要不同組合方法，並應及早用獨立測量發現。~The final connection in a closed wall inherits earlier positioning errors; individually acceptable piles do not guarantee closure. Errors may share a systematic direction or be independent random deviations, requiring different combination rules. Independent survey should identify the distinction before the final opening becomes too constrained to correct. || 假設4項獨立零均值誤差各標準差σ=15 mm，合成σtot=√(4σ²)=30 mm~For four independent zero-mean errors each with standard deviation σ=15 mm, combined σtot=√(4σ²)=30 mm || 用獨立控制網重測起終點，將誤差方向分解，檢查共同偏移後再作統計合成。~Resurvey start and closure points from independent control, resolving error directions and checking common bias before statistical combination. || 把系統偏差誤當隨機誤差會低估閉合缺口，最後一樁可能難以兼顧咬合與鋼筋籠淨距。~Treating systematic bias as random underestimates closure gaps and can leave the final pile unable to achieve both overlap and cage clearance. || 四項定位誤差一律都可以用平方和開根號合成。~Four positioning errors can always be combined by root-sum-square. || 設置中途閉合檢核與備用修正區，測量負責人應在樁序逼近最後接頭前提交偏差分析。~Provide interim closure checks and a correction allowance; the survey lead reports deviations before the pile sequence approaches the final connection. || 平方和開根號只適用於指定的獨立隨機假設，最不利容差疊加須另算；標準差也不是最大可能誤差。~Root-sum-square applies only under the stated independence assumptions; worst-case tolerance accumulation requires separate analysis, and a standard deviation is not a maximum error.
樁趾嵌入~Toe embedment || 開挖面以下的樁段藉由土體反力提供轉動拘束與側向平衡，嵌入深度同時影響止水路徑。土體被動反力需要位移才能動員，不能只用幾何深度宣稱固定端；深部軟弱層或滲流可能削弱原本假設的支承。~The embedded pile below excavation provides rotational restraint and lateral equilibrium through soil reaction while also lengthening seepage paths. Passive resistance needs movement to mobilize, so embedment depth alone does not establish a fixed end. Deep weak layers or seepage can reduce the assumed support and alter wall deformation. || 假設每米牆長的反力R=500 kN/m、對開挖底的力臂z=2 m，抗力矩M=Rz=1000 kN·m/m~For reaction R=500 kN per metre of wall and lever arm z=2 m about excavation level, resisting moment M=Rz=1000 kN·m/m || 以地層剖面、樁長與深部傾度曲線核對反力區，檢查支點是否隨開挖或水位改變。~Check reaction zones against stratigraphy, pile length and deep inclinometer profiles, examining whether restraint changes with excavation or groundwater. || 未到達設計嵌入層會使牆趾旋轉，表面支撐力可能上升並伴隨開挖底隆起。~Failure to reach the intended bearing stratum allows toe rotation, potentially increasing strut force and causing base movement. || 只要樁長達到圖面數字，樁趾就一定是完全固定。~Reaching the drawing's pile length guarantees a fully fixed toe. || 樁底地層與深度須留可追溯紀錄；地層異常由地工設計者重新核定嵌入及支撐配置。~Retain traceable toe-depth and ground records; the geotechnical designer revises embedment and support layout when unexpected strata are encountered. || 反力乘力臂是力矩平衡，不證明土體能動員該反力；承載、變形、基底隆起及滲流穩定均須獨立檢查。~Reaction times lever arm is equilibrium, not proof that soil can mobilize the reaction; resistance, deformation, base heave and seepage stability require independent checks.
缺口漏水~Defect leakage || 咬合牆的水密性常由局部缺口或施工接面控制，而不是整個混凝土樁的平均滲透性。流量與缺口面積及水力坡降相關，隨開挖降水增加的壓差會放大弱路徑；帶砂出水則表示地層本身可能正在流失。~Secant-wall sealing is often controlled by local gaps or construction interfaces rather than average concrete permeability. Flow depends on defect area and hydraulic gradient, and drawdown increases the driving pressure along weak paths. Sediment-carrying inflow indicates that the ground itself may be escaping, not merely water leaking through a stable interface. || 假設缺口等效k=1×10⁻⁶ m/s、A=0.5 m²、i=10，Q=kAi=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s~For equivalent defect permeability k=1×10⁻⁶ m/s, area A=0.5 m² and gradient i=10, Q=kAi=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s || 分區量測出水量與混濁度，對照內外水頭及孔斜模型，辨認缺口而非直接推定整牆材料不良。~Measure zoned flow and turbidity against internal-external heads and bore-deviation models to identify gaps rather than assuming uniformly poor wall material. || 集中漏水可帶走細砂，形成外側空洞與沉陷；只封內側漏點可能使壓力轉移到另一缺口。~Concentrated leakage can remove fines and form external voids and settlement; sealing one internal leak may transfer pressure to another gap. || 小流量清水滲漏永遠不會演變成帶砂地層流失。~A small clear-water leak can never develop into sediment-carrying ground loss. || 異常出水需建立位置、水頭與顆粒紀錄；修補由地工及壁體設計者共同核定並觀察周邊沉陷。~Record leak location, head and particles; geotechnical and wall designers jointly approve repair and require observation of adjacent settlement. || 等效達西模型只供量級比較，開放裂縫可能屬非達西流；沒有水頭資料就不能從一次流量倒推出可靠滲透係數。~The equivalent Darcy model provides scale only; open fractures may be non-Darcy, and one discharge measurement without head data cannot establish reliable permeability.
彎曲應力增量~Bending-stress increment || 壁體應變及彎曲需求可用截面模數建立簡化關係，但開裂鋼筋混凝土的應力分布與未開裂截面不同。從量測應力反推彎矩前，需知道所用位置及中性軸，不能把單側應變當純彎曲而忽略軸力與溫度。~Section modulus provides a simplified relation between bending and stress, but cracked reinforced concrete differs from an uncracked section. Inferring moment from a measured stress requires the measurement location and neutral axis. One-sided strain cannot be treated as pure bending without separating axial force and temperature effects. || 假設線彈性截面模數Z=0.04 m³、彎曲應力增量Δσ=20 MPa，ΔM=ΔσZ=0.8 MN·m=800 kN·m~For elastic section modulus Z=0.04 m³ and bending-stress increment Δσ=20 MPa, ΔM=ΔσZ=0.8 MN·m=800 kN·m || 使用兩側應變與溫度資料分離軸向及彎曲增量，核對所採截面模數與實際開裂狀態。~Use opposite-face strain and temperature to separate axial and bending increments, verifying the selected section modulus against the actual cracked condition. || 把鋼筋局部應變乘上整體毛截面參數，會得到不相容的彎矩，導致錯誤支撐需求。~Combining local reinforcement strain with incompatible gross-section properties produces erroneous moments and misleading support demands. || 任何一個應變計都可直接量出整根樁的彎矩。~Any single strain gauge directly measures the entire pile's bending moment. || 監測解算式應由結構設計者確認材料、位置及零點；儀器更換與截面狀態改變都須重新評估換算關係。~The structural designer approves materials, positions and zero references used in monitoring conversion; sensor replacement or section changes require renewed assessment. || 這是線彈性應力增量示範，不是混凝土容許應力；若截面開裂或配筋受力，應採相容的換算截面或非線性分析。~This illustrates an elastic stress increment, not an allowable concrete stress; cracking or reinforcement action requires compatible transformed-section or nonlinear analysis.
偏斜容差餘量~Deviation allowance || 設計咬合量需留給施工偏差、直徑變異與量測不確定度，不能全部視為可使用的止水厚度。兩樁向相反方向偏斜時，最小咬合會同時被削減；誤差有相關性時，最不利組合比平均值更能指出需要驗證的深度。~Nominal overlap must accommodate positional errors, diameter variation and measurement uncertainty rather than all being credited as usable cutoff thickness. Opposite deviations of adjacent piles reduce overlap simultaneously. Where errors are correlated, adverse combinations identify critical depths more effectively than average deviations do. || 名目咬合o=0.20 m、兩樁各向外偏移δ=0.06 m，最小線性餘量omin=o−2δ=0.08 m~For nominal overlap o=0.20 m and outward deviation δ=0.06 m for each pile, minimum linear reserve omin=o−2δ=0.08 m || 將全深孔斜與直徑量測的誤差範圍一起合成，檢查最小交集是否仍覆蓋需要止水的含水層。~Combine full-depth deviation and diameter uncertainty, checking whether the minimum intersection still spans the aquifers requiring cutoff. || 只用平均偏斜可能掩蓋局部不咬合，低滲透層上方的細小缺口也可能形成主要水路。~Mean deviation can conceal a local separation, and a small gap above a low-permeability layer can become the dominant water path. || 設計咬合量扣除平均偏差後為正，就不需其他驗證。~Positive overlap after subtracting mean deviation needs no further verification. || 竣工資料須指出最不利深度及剩餘不確定度；若餘量小於核定要求，設計者應指定補測或補強停留點。~As-built records identify adverse depths and residual uncertainty; when reserve is below approved requirements, the designer specifies additional investigation or strengthening hold points. || 線性相減是保守幾何示意，沒有涵蓋三維曲線樁形與材料缺陷；正餘量亦不能自行證明接面強度與水密。~Linear subtraction is an adverse geometric illustration, not a full curved-pile model; positive reserve does not independently establish interface strength or sealing.
營運漏水趨勢~Operational leakage trend || 完工後的滲漏量需連同外水頭與降雨判讀，相同流量可能來自不同壓差。長期裂縫、接面位移與水化學沉積會改變路徑，流量下降也可能是排水口堵塞而非牆體改善；交接紀錄必須保存可比較的環境基準。~Operational leakage must be interpreted with external head and rainfall because identical flow can occur under different pressure differences. Cracking, joint movement and chemical deposits change paths over time; falling flow may mean an obstructed drain rather than improved wall sealing. Handover must preserve comparable environmental baselines. || 假設收集漏水V=12 L、時間t=6 h，平均Q=V/t=2 L/h~For collected leakage V=12 L over t=6 h, mean discharge Q=V/t=2 L/h || 用固定集水區與校正容器量測流量，記錄外水位及清理事件，將趨勢和鄰房高程一起檢視。~Measure discharge with fixed catchments and calibrated containers, record external levels and cleaning events, and review trends beside neighbouring-building elevations. || 無環境基準的流量比較可能漏掉排水堵塞，水壓升高後才在其他接頭出現新的滲漏。~Flow comparisons without environmental baselines can miss drainage blockage until higher pressure creates leakage at other joints. || 漏水量逐年下降就一定表示牆體性能逐年改善。~Declining annual leakage necessarily indicates improving wall performance. || 維護移交應包括接頭圖、集水範圍及異常回報責任；營運單位遇到水頭與流量不一致時應請設計專業判讀。~Handover includes joint maps, catchments and reporting responsibilities; operators seek engineering interpretation when head and flow trends disagree. || 短期平均流量不代表永久水密程度，也不是通用允收值；應依資產用途、地下水與地層流失風險建立專案標準。~Short-term mean discharge is not permanent sealing performance or a universal limit; project criteria depend on asset use, groundwater and potential ground loss.
'''),'原創教學例：相同圓樁直徑D=1.0 m，中心距s=0.8 m，名目咬合o=D−s=0.20 m。若只把中心距增加10%至0.88 m，樁徑不變，咬合減為0.12 m，降低40%。這顯示接近幾何閉合條件時，小幅位置變更可消耗很大的餘量。實際還須扣除孔斜、樁徑變異及測量誤差，並用全深相鄰樁位置重建止水路徑；正的名目咬合不是接面水密或結構抗剪已獲證明。~Original teaching example: equal circular piles have D=1.0 m and centre spacing s=0.8 m, giving nominal overlap o=D−s=0.20 m. Increase spacing alone by 10% to 0.88 m while holding diameter fixed: overlap becomes 0.12 m, a 40% reduction. This shows how a small positional change can consume substantial reserve near a geometric closure condition. Actual evaluation must also account for inclination, diameter variation and survey uncertainty and reconstruct the full-depth cutoff using adjacent-pile positions. Positive nominal overlap does not demonstrate either watertight contact or structural shear transfer. Verify the geometric prediction against independent survey and observed hydraulic behaviour.',['keller-secant','geo-site','geo-wall','fhwa-ground'],['倫敦本傑明街地下室~Benjamin Street basement, London','倫敦哈利街一四一號地下室~141 Harley Street basement, London'])

add('b182','圍堰水壓、圍檁支撐與基底滲流穩定~Cofferdam water pressure, walers, struts and base seepage','鋼板樁圍堰的安全取決於水土壓、支撐系統、鎖口止水與開挖底部的滲流穩定。本課以逐階段自由體圖連結抽水、支撐預力、樁趾被動反力及拆撐，並檢查角隅扭矩、水流拖曳與材料劣化，避免只用單根板樁彎矩代表整個圍堰。~Sheet-pile cofferdams depend on water and earth pressures, bracing, interlock sealing and base seepage stability. Stage-specific free bodies connect dewatering, support force, toe resistance and removal, with checks of corner torsion, current drag and deterioration beyond the bending demand of one sheet pile.',compact(r'''
靜水壓合力~Hydrostatic resultant || 圍堰抽水降低內側水位，外側靜水壓沿深度增加，合力及作用點共同決定板樁與支撐需求。水位差變化會同時改變側壓及底部滲流，不能把抽水只當作施工準備；分層水位或波動需按相應邊界逐階段更新。~Dewatering lowers the inside level while external hydrostatic pressure rises with depth; both resultant and application point govern sheets and braces. Water-level changes also alter base seepage, so pumping is a structural stage rather than mere preparation. Layered heads and fluctuations require stage-specific boundary updates. || 外側水深H=6 m、內側乾燥、γw=9.81 kN/m³，每米牆合力P=γwH²/2=176.6 kN/m~For external depth H=6 m, a dry inside and γw=9.81 kN/m³, force per wall metre P=γwH²/2=176.6 kN/m || 以內外水位計建立壓力圖，核對作用點與支撐標高，對照板樁位移及支撐反力。~Use inside and outside level gauges to build pressure diagrams, checking application points and brace elevations against sheet movement and strut reactions. || 抽水後若支撐未形成完整力流，板樁可能快速變形，水壓與土壓需求一起超過臨時狀態能力。~Dewatering before the full brace load path exists can cause rapid sheet movement as combined water and soil demands exceed temporary-stage resistance. || 水位差增加一倍，靜水壓合力只會增加一倍。~Doubling water-level difference only doubles the hydrostatic resultant. || 每次改變水位應對照核定支撐階段；抽水放行由臨時工程與地工設計者共同確認。~Check every level change against the approved brace stage; temporary-works and geotechnical designers jointly release dewatering. || 三角形公式假設單側靜水且內側乾燥；兩側都有水時應相減完整壓力圖，不能無條件只代水位差平方。~The triangular expression assumes one-sided static water and a dry interior; with water on both sides subtract complete pressure diagrams rather than automatically squaring the level difference.
圍檁跨距~Waler span || 圍檁收集多片板樁的側向反力並傳給離散支撐，跨距、連續性及支撐座位置因此決定局部彎矩。荷載不一定均布，板樁接觸不良會使部分圍檁先受力；施工偏心也可能讓名義平面彎曲變成扭轉與局部腹板承壓。~Walers collect reactions from multiple sheets and transfer them to discrete braces, making span, continuity and seating position critical to local bending. Loads need not be uniform: poor contact concentrates reactions, while construction eccentricity can add torsion and local web bearing to nominal in-plane bending. || 假設簡支圍檁均布w=80 kN/m、跨距L=3 m，M=wL²/8=90 kN·m~For a simply supported waler with w=80 kN/m and span L=3 m, M=wL²/8=90 kN·m || 核對實際支點間距與板樁接觸，量測圍檁側移及支撐反力，檢查接頭是否位於高彎矩區。~Verify actual brace spacing and sheet contact, measure waler displacement and reactions, and inspect whether splices lie in high-moment zones. || 圍檁背後空隙會讓局部板樁超彎，未加勁腹板也可能在支撐座先壓潰。~Gaps behind walers can overbend individual sheets, while an unstiffened web may crush locally at a strut seat. || 圍檁截面夠大就不必檢查支撐座與板樁接觸。~A large waler section removes the need to inspect seats and sheet contact. || 接觸墊塊、接頭與腹板加勁須依圖驗收；任何支撐間距變更由臨時工程設計者核准。~Inspect contact packs, splices and web stiffeners against drawings; the temporary-works designer approves every change in brace spacing. || 簡支均布式只提供比較量級，連續梁、接頭滑移與角隅都會改變彎矩分布；構件強度與側向穩定須另查。~The simple uniform-load expression is a scale comparison; continuity, splice slip and corners alter moment distribution, and member resistance and lateral stability require separate checks.
支撐挫屈~Strut buckling || 受壓支撐會受整體挫屈控制，長度與端部拘束的影響可能比截面面積更大。安裝彎曲、接頭偏心與側向支承失效會降低承載，不能把理想歐拉荷重當可直接使用的設計抗力；施工期間堆料也可能增加橫向彎曲。~Compression struts may be governed by global buckling, with length and end restraint more influential than area alone. Initial bow, splice eccentricity and lost lateral restraint reduce resistance. Ideal Euler load is not directly usable design resistance, and construction stockpiles may add transverse bending to the member. || 假設鉸接有效長L=8 m、E=200 GPa、I=0.0002 m⁴，Pcr=π²EI/L²=6.17 MN~For pinned effective length L=8 m, E=200 GPa and I=0.0002 m⁴, Pcr=π²EI/L²=6.17 MN || 量測直線度與側向支承位置，檢查接頭轉動及偏心，將實際端部條件帶入構件穩定分析。~Measure straightness and lateral-restraint positions, inspect splice rotation and eccentricity, and use actual end conditions in member-stability analysis. || 側向繫材被拆或支撐初彎過大，可能在材料尚未達降伏時失穩並使鄰跨連鎖超載。~Removed lateral ties or excessive initial bow can trigger instability before material yielding and redistribute overload into adjacent bays. || 支撐軸應力低於降伏強度就不可能挫屈。~A strut cannot buckle when axial stress is below yield strength. || 支撐不得被當未核准的吊掛梁使用；移除側向約束前須由臨時工程設計者重新核算有效長度。~Do not use struts as unapproved lifting beams; the temporary-works designer recalculates effective length before lateral restraint is removed. || 歐拉式假設彈性、理想直桿與指定端部條件；設計抗力還須納入缺陷、局部挫屈與規範折減，不是本算值本身。~Euler theory assumes an elastic straight ideal member with specified ends; design resistance also includes imperfections, local buckling and code reductions rather than using this number directly.
鎖口漏水~Interlock leakage || 板樁鎖口提供相互連接卻不一定天然水密，施工損傷與不連續封材可形成縱向漏水路徑。多處小漏點相加後會影響排水容量，若伴隨細砂則也涉及地層流失；鎖口幾何及實際嵌合需要與水頭一起判讀。~Interlocks connect sheets but are not inherently watertight; driving damage and discontinuous sealant create longitudinal leakage paths. Many small leaks can consume pumping capacity, while entrained fines indicate ground loss. Interlock geometry and actual engagement must therefore be interpreted together with hydraulic head. || 假設20處鎖口各漏q=0.3 L/min，總Q=20q=6 L/min~For twenty interlocks each leaking q=0.3 L/min, total flow Q=20q=6 L/min || 分區收集流量並記外水頭，檢查接縫走向、混濁度及漏點是否隨抽水階段擴大。~Collect flow by zone and record external head, inspecting seam alignment, turbidity and whether leaks expand through dewatering stages. || 脫扣或破損鎖口可能造成帶砂集中湧水，增加抽水量並誘發圍堰外地層沉陷。~A disengaged or damaged interlock may produce concentrated sediment-carrying inflow, increasing pumping and causing ground settlement outside the cofferdam. || 鋼板樁已互鎖就表示圍堰完全不會漏水。~Interlocked sheet piles make the cofferdam completely watertight. || 鎖口修補需同時查外水頭及地層流失，補漏停留點由圍堰設計者確認，不以泵浦尚能排除作唯一判據。~Leak repair must consider external head and soil loss; the cofferdam designer confirms repair hold points rather than relying only on available pumping capacity. || 線性加總假設各漏點保持原流量，實際堵塞或壓力重分配會改變總量；流量合格仍不能證明無帶砂風險。~Linear summation assumes unchanged individual leakage; blockage and pressure redistribution alter totals, and acceptable flow does not establish absence of soil-transport risk.
基底臨界坡降~Critical base gradient || 向上滲流會減少土粒有效重量，當滲透力接近浮重時，顆粒接觸力大幅降低並可能形成砂湧。基底管湧不一定與板樁彎曲超載同時發生，因此結構支撐足夠仍需獨立查滲流路徑、出口坡降及反濾保護。~Upward seepage reduces effective grain weight; as seepage force approaches submerged weight, contact forces fall and boiling may develop. Hydraulic instability need not coincide with excessive sheet bending. Adequate structural bracing therefore still requires independent assessment of seepage paths, exit gradients and filter protection. || 假設土粒比重Gs=2.65、孔隙比e=0.65，理想臨界坡降icr=(Gs−1)/(1+e)=1.0~For grain specific gravity Gs=2.65 and void ratio e=0.65, ideal critical gradient icr=(Gs−1)/(1+e)=1.0 || 用分層水壓計估計基底水頭差，配合土樣孔隙比及出口位置，檢查坡降集中而非只取平均值。~Estimate base head differences with multilevel piezometers, combine sample void ratio and exit location, and assess gradient concentration rather than only average gradient. || 基底砂湧會流失土粒並削弱樁趾反力，繼而影響整體圍堰；表面出水量不大也不能忽略。~Base boiling removes soil and weakens toe restraint, subsequently affecting the whole cofferdam; even modest visible flow can be significant. || 鋼板樁不會彎壞就代表基底不可能發生管湧。~If the sheets do not fail in bending, the base cannot suffer piping. || 抽水計畫需設水壓及帶砂觀測停留點；地工設計者確認出口坡降與反濾條件後才改變內水位。~Dewatering plans include pressure and sediment hold points; the geotechnical designer confirms exit gradients and filtration before internal levels change. || 這是均質無黏性土的理想起浮條件，非專案安全係數；內部侵蝕可在其他條件下發生，分層與集中水路須另外分析。~This is an ideal heave condition for homogeneous cohesionless soil, not a project safety factor; internal erosion can occur under other conditions, requiring analysis of layering and concentrated paths.
樁趾被動反力~Toe passive resistance || 板樁嵌入開挖底以下，藉由前方土體被動作用提供平衡，但動員此抗力需要適當位移。開挖擾動、沖刷或砂湧會減少可用深度，若把全被動強度無條件計入，將高估支承並低估板樁轉動及支撐力。~Embedded sheets mobilize passive soil resistance below excavation, but that resistance requires displacement. Disturbance, scour or boiling reduces usable embedment. Crediting full passive strength unconditionally overstates restraint and underestimates sheet rotation and brace force, particularly when soil and structural deformation compatibility has not been checked. || 假設有效單位重γ′=10 kN/m³、Kp=3、嵌深d=3 m，理想Pp=0.5Kpγ′d²=135 kN/m~For effective unit weight γ′=10 kN/m³, Kp=3 and embedment d=3 m, ideal Pp=0.5Kpγ′d²=135 kN/m || 核對實際開挖面與沖刷高程，量測深部位移並比較土體可動員反力曲線，不只查樁長。~Verify excavation and scour elevations, measure deep movement and compare mobilizable soil-reaction curves rather than checking pile length alone. || 趾前土體被超挖或沖刷會使有效嵌入縮短，板樁旋轉後可能把額外荷載轉給上層支撐。~Overexcavation or scour ahead of the toe shortens effective embedment, allowing rotation and transferring extra demand to upper braces. || 圖面嵌入深度不變，樁趾抗力就永遠不變。~Toe resistance remains unchanged whenever the drawing's embedment length is unchanged. || 基底整平與清淤須控制實際高程，超挖應由地工設計者核准補救後才繼續下一施工階段。~Control actual elevations during trimming and dredging; the geotechnical designer approves remedies for overexcavation before the next stage proceeds. || 公式假設均質土、水平地面及理想被動狀態，未含折減與變形要求；實際設計需考慮水壓和土壓分開的有效應力分析。~The expression assumes uniform soil, level ground and an ideal passive state without reductions or movement requirements; actual design separates water and effective earth pressures.
抽水荷載增量~Dewatering load increment || 內部水位下降時，原先平衡外水壓的一部分內壓被移除，支撐需求因而增加。分析必須以固定板樁高程比較前後兩張壓力圖，不能只看水深數字；若抽水與開挖同時進行，土壓重分配也需另列。~Lowering internal water removes part of the pressure that previously balanced the external side, increasing brace demand. Compare complete pressure diagrams at fixed sheet elevations rather than depth numbers alone. When pumping and excavation occur together, earth-pressure redistribution must be accounted for separately from the hydraulic change. || 僅比較同底部的三角形水壓合力，水深H₁=6 m與H₂=4 m，ΔP=9.81(H₁²−H₂²)/2=98.1 kN/m~Comparing triangular pressure resultants with one common base at depths H₁=6 m and H₂=4 m, ΔP=9.81(H₁²−H₂²)/2=98.1 kN/m || 同步記錄內外水位與支撐軸力，按固定高程積分壓力增量，檢查反力變化是否符合階段分析。~Synchronize water levels and strut loads, integrate pressure increments over fixed elevations, and check reactions against stage analysis. || 同時降低水位與移除支撐會疊加不利作用，可能讓尚未形成永久支承的板樁失去平衡。~Lowering water while removing braces combines adverse actions and may destabilize sheets before permanent restraint is available. || 抽水與拆撐可以分別驗算後任意同時進行。~Separately checked dewatering and brace removal can be performed together arbitrarily. || 每個水位與拆撐組合須有核定階段編號；臨時工程設計者確認實際順序後才放行。~Assign an approved stage identifier to each water-level and brace-removal combination; the temporary-works designer releases the actual sequence. || 此差值僅比較指定兩個三角形合力，作用點也會改變；若分析兩側水位差，需保留共同底高與完整壓力分布。~The difference compares the specified triangular resultants only, whose application points also change; two-sided water-level analysis needs a common base and complete pressure distributions.
角隅偏心~Corner eccentricity || 圍堰角隅把兩個方向的圍檁反力轉接到支撐，幾何偏心容易產生額外扭矩。直線段的平面梁分析不能自動涵蓋角接件、焊接與腹板局部承壓，若支撐軸線未交會，荷載路徑需要明確的三維構件傳遞。~Cofferdam corners transfer waler reactions from two directions into bracing, with geometric eccentricity producing extra torsion. A straight-wall planar beam analysis does not automatically cover corner fittings, welds or local web bearing. Nonintersecting strut axes require an explicit three-dimensional structural path for the forces. || 假設支撐力P=500 kN、偏心距e=0.15 m，附加扭矩T=Pe=75 kN·m~For brace force P=500 kN and eccentricity e=0.15 m, additional torque T=Pe=75 kN·m || 測量支撐軸線與圍檁剪力中心相對位置，核對角接件加勁及焊縫，檢查扭轉位移。~Survey strut axes relative to the waler shear centre, inspect corner stiffening and welds, and check torsional movement. || 偏心未納入會使角接板翹曲或焊縫受額外作用，局部失效可中斷兩側圍檁的傳力。~Omitted eccentricity can distort corner plates or overload welds, interrupting load transfer from both adjoining walers. || 支撐只有軸力，所以角隅接頭不可能承受扭矩。~An axially loaded strut cannot introduce torsion into a corner connection. || 角隅應有獨立三維詳圖及安裝容差；現場調整接件位置須由連接設計者重新檢查偏心。~Provide dedicated three-dimensional corner details and installation tolerances; the connection designer reassesses eccentricity after field positioning changes. || 力乘偏心只是附加扭矩，不包含兩方向力的合成與接頭剛度；連接強度及圍檁扭轉穩定仍需另外驗算。~Force times eccentricity is only the added torque; combined two-direction loading and connection stiffness require further analysis, including connection resistance and waler torsional stability.
水流拖曳~Current drag || 圍堰暴露於水流時，流速、投影面積與形狀決定拖曳作用，與靜水壓屬不同荷載來源。漂流物或局部流束會改變有效面積及阻力，洪水期間的水位與流速也可能同時增加，不能只沿用施工初期的靜水情境。~Current drag is distinct from hydrostatic pressure and depends on velocity, projected area and shape. Debris and local jets can change effective area and resistance, while flood levels and velocities may rise together. The initial construction hydrostatic case therefore does not necessarily represent later environmental demand. || 假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Cd=1.2、投影面積A=10 m²、流速v=2 m/s，F=0.5ρCdAv²=24000 N=24 kN~For ρ=1000 kg/m³, Cd=1.2, projected area A=10 m² and v=2 m/s, F=0.5ρCdAv²=24000 N=24 kN || 比對現場流速剖面與水位資料，檢查漂流物附著及局部沖刷，核對投影面積是否因設備改變。~Compare velocity profiles and water levels, inspect debris accumulation and local scour, and check whether equipment changes alter projected area. || 漂流物增加迎水面積可提高拖曳並導致沖刷，趾部抗力下降又使圍堰側移增加。~Debris increases exposed area and can intensify drag and scour, while reduced toe resistance further increases cofferdam movement. || 水流荷載與流速成正比，所以流速加倍只增一倍力。~Current force is linear in velocity, so doubling velocity only doubles force. || 汛期檢查需包含水流、漂流物及沖刷高程；水工與臨時工程設計者共同核准荷載更新與停工條件。~Flood-season inspections include current, debris and scour elevation; hydraulic and temporary-works designers jointly approve load updates and stop conditions. || 阻力係數依形狀及流況而變，此式不含波浪、撞擊或渦激效應；不能把假設係數直接當通用設計值。~The drag coefficient depends on shape and flow regime; this expression excludes waves, impact and vortex effects, and the assumed coefficient is not universal.
拆撐跨距變化~Span change after removal || 拆除一層支撐會改變板樁及圍檁的有效跨距，原有內力隨新的邊界重新分配。永久結構必須先形成可證明的替代支承，材料強度達標並不保證連接已完成；拆撐順序常比最終狀態更容易產生不利彎曲與位移。~Removing a brace changes effective sheet and waler spans and redistributes forces under new boundaries. Permanent works must first provide demonstrable replacement restraint; adequate material strength does not prove completed connections. The removal sequence may produce more adverse bending and movement than the final state. || 僅比較等均布載重簡支梁，原跨L₁=3 m、拆撐後L₂=5 m，M₂/M₁=(5/3)²=2.78~For equal uniform load on simple beams, changing span from L₁=3 m to L₂=5 m gives M₂/M₁=(5/3)²=2.78 || 拆撐前檢查永久連接、實際強度與支承間隙，對比每一階段分析的位移與反力，保留卸載監測。~Before removal, inspect permanent connections, actual strength and support gaps; compare stage predictions with movement and reaction measurements and retain unloading records. || 永久樓板尚未有效接觸牆體就拆撐，可能形成短暫長跨，導致板樁過彎或不可逆地層位移。~Removing braces before permanent slabs engage the wall creates a temporary long span, causing excessive sheet bending or irreversible ground movement. || 最終永久結構足夠強，所以拆撐順序不影響安全。~A strong final permanent structure makes brace-removal sequence irrelevant. || 每層拆撐設獨立停留點，臨時與永久結構設計者共同簽認替代力流及卸載監測後才放行。~Provide a separate hold point for each brace level; temporary and permanent designers jointly confirm replacement load paths and unloading monitoring before release. || 平方比只適用於假設的簡支均布系統，實際連續壁及土彈簧會改變分配；應依真實拆撐階段重新分析，而非套用倍率設計。~The squared ratio applies only to the assumed simple uniform-load system; wall continuity and soil springs change redistribution, requiring analysis of actual removal stages rather than design by this multiplier.
'''),'原創教學例：內側乾燥、外側水深H=6 m、γw=9.81 kN/m³，靜水壓合力P=γwH²/2=176.58 kN/m。若水深增加10%至6.6 m，P=9.81×6.6²/2=213.66 kN/m，增加21%。同時三角形合力作用點也隨水深改變，因此板樁與支撐彎矩不一定只增加21%。本例未含土壓、波流、兩側有水或基底滲流；須把每種荷載放在同一高程基準的自由體圖，再檢查整體平衡、構件與水力穩定。~Original teaching example: with a dry interior, external depth H=6 m and γw=9.81 kN/m³, hydrostatic resultant P=γwH²/2=176.58 kN/m. Increase depth by 10% to 6.6 m and P=9.81×6.6²/2=213.66 kN/m, a 21% rise. The triangular resultant application point also changes, so sheet and brace moments need not increase by exactly 21%. Earth pressure, waves, two-sided water and base seepage are excluded. Put all relevant loads on free bodies with a common elevation datum, then check overall equilibrium, structural members and hydraulic stability separately. Measured water levels and the installed bracing arrangement must match the stage being assessed.',['usace-sheet','geo-site','geo-wall'],['倫敦Crossrail：深開挖支撐比較~London Crossrail: deep-excavation bracing comparison','詹森礦井：閉合圍護幾何比較~Jansen Mine: closed-enclosure geometry comparison'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
